<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">TITAN MINING CORPORATION</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Notes to the Condensed Consolidated Interim Financial Statements</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">For the Three and Nine months ended September 30, 2025 and 2024</P>

<P STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; font: italic 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">(Expressed in thousands of US
dollars, unless otherwise indicated - Unaudited)</P>

