<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-weight: normal">In December
2024, the Company entered into an amendment to its previously signed hedge facility agreement &ldquo;ISDA Master Agreement&rdquo; that
was entered into with National Bank of Canada (&ldquo;NBC&rdquo;) in June 2022. The amendment provides the Company with an up to US$1.35
million collateralized facility enabling additional access to funds for future zinc contract commitments. As at September 30, 2025 and
December 31, 2024, there were no open Zinc Swap contracts. </FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-weight: normal">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

