<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 17.85pt">17.</TD><TD>SEGMENTED INFORMATION</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 17.85pt; text-indent: -17.85pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company operates one reportable segment, mineral
production and exploration in the United States. The Company&rsquo;s non-current assets located in the United States total $37,227 and
those located in Canada total $206.</P>

